// A paddle at `x`, whose centre is p[y]. The ball reverses only when it is
// travelling *towards* that paddle, for the same reason the wall test checks its
// direction -- and the overlap is the two boxes' half-widths, 3 and 3, plus the
// paddle's half-height, 20.
